    <color r="255" g="255" b="255">
     <font name="Gulim" size="12" shadowx="2" shadowy="1" shadowa="50">Fun facts about the Bonnethead Shark</font>
    </color>
   </cell>
   <p />
   <cell width="280" bgimg="ui/zoopedia/factBG.tga" padx="10">
